  - Do you recommend gathering additional evidence now, or would that create disclosure/exposure risks?
  - What is our strategy going into the hearing (bench trial, settlement posture, motion practice)?
- Costs & burden
  - Rough estimate of costs/time to obtain additional evidence (subpoenas, expert fees, investigators).
- Next steps & client tasks
  - What exactly do you want me to do right now? (e.g., collect X documents, contact Y witness, preserve Z data)
  - Is there anything I should stop doing or keep preserved (phones, cloud backups, delete/retain policies)?
- Communications & availability
  - Would you like to schedule a short call to review priorities and next steps? When are you available?
