- Termination notice, performance reviews, disciplinary records, warnings.  
- All email and text message communications with HR, managers, coworkers related to the dispute. (Include dates/times.)  
- Pay stubs, payroll records, wage statements, bonus documentation, expense reimbursements.  
- Timecards, schedules, calendar invites, meeting notes.  
- Any written demand letters or communications from the creditor/opposing counsel.  
- Bank statements, invoices, receipts that support damages or payments.  
- Witness names, contact info, and short notes on what each would testify to.  
- Copies of the discovery responses we provided and what the opposing party produced.  
- Any photographs, screenshots, or other digital evidence (preserve originals).

