I see from your notes that you’re working with Robert Kim at Kim & Associates and want to be ready for the next legal steps. I can help by (a) giving a short checklist of questions to ask your attorney about gathering more evidence, and (b) drafting a quick email you can send to Robert. Which would you like — both, or just the email?

