- Has discovery officially closed, and are we still able to add evidence before the hearing?
- Is there any additional evidence you recommend I collect (specific documents, communications, receipts, bank statements, etc.)?
- Do you think witness statements or declarations would help? If so, who should I ask to provide them and what should they say?
