- Whether we should retain any expert witnesses or additional declarants
- Whether any further discovery is advisable (depositions, document requests)
- Potential pretrial motions we should prepare (summary judgment, motions in limine, etc.)
- Strategy for settlement vs. proceeding to hearing
- Any formatting/filing steps I should follow if I need to submit exhibits or declarations
- Best way to organize exhibits/witnesses for trial

