Best,  
[Your name]  

Document checklist you can offer your attorney
- Copy of the signed contract(s) and any amendments
- All written communications (emails, texts, letters) with the employer/creditor
- Invoices, receipts, billing statements, payment records, bank statements
- Any demand letters or notices received from the creditor
- Discovery responses and production we’ve already provided/received
- Deposition transcripts (if any)
- Notes or timeline of key events with dates and witnesses
- Witness contact info and short statements of what they can testify to
- Relevant policies, employee handbooks, or internal memos (if employer dispute)
- Any prior settlement offers or negotiations

Next steps for me
