- Proof of service / complaint / your filed answer and any court filings
- Discovery responses (yours and theirs), deposition transcripts, interrogatories, requests for production
- Witness names and short notes on what each can testify to
- Any relevant policies, manuals, or industry standards if applicable
- Photos, screenshots, or physical evidence with date/time metadata where possible

