- Draft this email into your drafts folder? (I can save it and you can review.)  
- Send it now? (If so I can send as a new message—give me the attorney’s email or I can search your inbox for prior messages to reply to.)  
- Or search your inbox for Robert Kim / Kim & Associates emails so I can reply to the latest thread?

Which would you prefer?

